{
  "summary": "This experiment tested a multimodal model combining scvi_n200 RNA and resnet50 image encoders with concat fusion in a singleprofile setting. The validation accuracy (0.5362) and F1 (0.5158) are lower than RNA-only baselines, suggesting multimodal approaches may not improve performance in this configuration. The impact of alternative fusion strategies or image encoders remains uncertain without direct comparisons."
}

